{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/hashicorp/tfci","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:11:45.692Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/hashicorp/tfci/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/hashicorp/tfci"},"readme":"<!-- Note: This repo contains images from [https://github.com/hashicorp/tfc-workflows-tooling](https://github.com/hashicorp/tfc-workflows-tooling). -->\n\n## Supported Platforms\n* GitHub Actions\n* GitLab Pipelines\n\n## Usage\n\nUsage depends on if the container is running on a local machine or in a CI environment such as GitHub Actions or GitLab Pipelines.\n\n```\ndocker run -it \\\n  -e \"TF_HOSTNAME\" \\\n  -e \"TF_API_TOKEN\" \\\n  -e \"TF_CLOUD_ORGANIZATION\" \\\n  hashicorp/tfci:latest \\\n  tfci run show --help\n```\n\nIf you desire to mock the container running in a GitHub Actions Runner environment, can do the following by passing environment variables to the container\n\n```\ndocker run -it \\\n  -e \"TF_HOSTNAME\" \\\n  -e \"TF_API_TOKEN\" \\\n  -e \"TF_CLOUD_ORGANIZATION\" \\\n  -e \"CI\" \\\n  -e \"GITHUB_ACTIONS\" \\\n  -e \"GITHUB_OUTPUT\" \\\n  -e \"GITHUB_SHA\" \\\n  -e \"GITHUB_ACTOR\" \\\n  -e \"GITHUB_ACTOR\" \\\n  hashicorp/tfci:latest \\\n  tfci run show --help\n```","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"hashicorpreleng","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/hashicorp","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2023-05-02T20:16:09.71292Z","updated":"2025-04-16T17:05:18.189057Z","categories":["Security","Languages & frameworks","Integration & delivery"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":8915078,"stars":1},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":159193370,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:57fead054ee0779e8f682711840fa6af4e60c0bc6cd883e1a91dc3bb20b4eace","pushed":"2025-04-16T17:05:16.988425Z","size":7486022,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/arm64","unknown/unknown"],"mediaType":"applicat